== Walkthrough ==

[[Priestess Caulria]] in the North Qeynos Temple (Take a left at the '''Temple of Life''' and enter the purple rings above the pond at (-160,-470) next to [[Astaed Wemor]])  gives the quest, which requires you to look into the occurrence of rabid wolves in the area.

'''Return a [[Diseased Wolf Pelt]].'''

:Priestess Caulria says, 'I see you have rid our land of a beast tainted with the blood of Bertoxxulous. The Prime Healer shall look favorably upon your soul. Here is our thanks and just in case the beast may have bitten you...'

[[Priestess Caulria]] will cast [[Cure Disease]] on you to remove [[Rabies]] and other diseases.

If you turn in the Pelts at the same time as someone else, you may not receive the Cure Disease cast.

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Priests of Life]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Knights of Thunder]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Guards of Qeynos]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Antonius Bayle]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Bloodsabers]] got worse.
</div>
